    "do_rpa": ["keyword", "toggle", "", false, "", "Enable the calculation of the RPA energy.\nIMPORTANT NOTES:\n(1) Works only in combination with Contour-deformation formalism with or without subspace approximation.\n(2) The flag has to be specified before the `begin qpoints` block, additionally an extra value at the end of\n    each q-point line has to be specified with the weight of the q-point for the BZ integration.\n(3) The imaginary frequency grid will be different than the one used in the standard GW Contour-deformation calculation\n    so if the `eps0mat[.h5]` and `epsmat[.h5]` files will be used for a subsequent sigma calculation the calculated `eqp`\n    will be different.", [], [], ""],
